            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 13 and 14</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> things does the manager say mentors can help with?</p>",
