            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 26–30</h3><p>What decision do the students make about each of the following parts of their presentation?</p><p>Choose <strong>FIVE</strong> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <strong>A–G</strong>, next to Questions 26–30.</p><p><strong>Decisions</strong></p>",
